# Is dit waar?

A free, non-profit fake-news checker for students (vo/mbo): a chatbot that helps check text and images, with sources. Website: [isditwaar.nl](https://isditwaar.nl)

This folder contains the free lesson materials that go with it.

## Contents
- `werkvormen/` – short activities for in class (PDF/docx)

